//! Core HTTP/1 primitives in Silk: RFC 7230/Fetch header validation, cached IMF-fixdate
//! formatting, the Node 24 STATUS_CODES table, NO_PROXY matching, and intrusive O(1)
//! ConnectionsList tracking for HTTP server timeouts.
